165/posts/default/4502112945095585945' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1277255046"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 25, 2012 at 6:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-87953340159394989</id><published>2012-10-25T17:50:35.961-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-25T17:50:35.961-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I hope that God has a special place reserved in he...</title><content type='html'>I hope that God has a special place reserved in hell for all of these evil people.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4502112945095585945/comments/default/87953340159394989'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4502112945095585945/comments/default/87953340159394989'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/bruce-jessen-torturer-in-pulpit.html?showComment=1351209035961#c87953340159394989' title=''/><author><name>Fred</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/10/bruce-jessen-torturer-in-pulpit.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4502112945095585945' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4502112945095585945' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1028516439"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 25, 2012 at 5:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3553530004816525538</id><published>2012-10-25T17:23:24.112-06:00</published><updated>2012-10-25T17:23:24.112-06:00</updated><title type='text'>The Inquisition is back, with a vengeance. &#xa;They&amp;#...</t